1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Hi, we're Team ECOMP-UFSM, from Brazil.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:08,000
NASA has watched fires from space since 2000,
but MODIS and VIIRS count them differently.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
This is FocoCerto Harmonizer.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
We put both sensors on one grid
and build a Fire Activity Calendar:

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
every week compared with its own history,
critical weeks in red.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
When a week turns critical, our agents draft
a brigade dispatch plan for the coordinator to approve.

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
From NASA data to crews on the ground.
